---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Purest Athlete Council — Purest Electrolyte" description="The Purest Athlete Council is our inner circle of active people who live the lifestyle, test the products, and help shape the brand. Apply to join.">
  <section class="container py-20 max-w-3xl">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <header class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-4">Purest Athlete Council</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium mb-6">More than an ambassador.<br/>Part of the brand.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-xl mx-auto">
        The Purest Athlete Council is our inner circle — a small group of athletes and active people who live this lifestyle for real. You help shape what we make next, and you're the face of why it matters.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- What It Means -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium mb-4">What it means to be on the Council</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        This isn't a transactional program. We're not looking for people to post and disappear. Council members are people Pam handpicks because they genuinely represent what Purest stands for — clean ingredients, real performance, and a life spent outdoors and in motion.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        You'll get to know Pam personally. You'll be asked for real feedback. And your community will see you as someone who helped build something — not just promote it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Perks -->
    <div class="mb-16 bg-secondary border border-border rounded-xl px-8 py-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium mb-6">Council member perks</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-foreground font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Free monthly supply</strong> — your Purest, every month, shipped to you at no cost</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-foreground font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <div><strong>20% commission</strong> on every sale you drive — higher than our standard affiliate rate</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-foreground font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Your own discount code</strong> — your community gets 15% off with your personal code</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-foreground font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <div><strong>First access to new flavors</strong> — you try it before anyone else and give us real feedback</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-foreground font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Featured on purestelectrolyte.com</strong> — your name, your sport, your story on our site</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-foreground font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Direct access to Pam</strong> — real relationship, real conversations, real collaboration</div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-foreground font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Co-creation opportunities</strong> — your input on future products, flavors, and content</div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Who We're Looking For -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium mb-4">Who we're looking for</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        Runners. Skiers. Surfers. Hikers. CrossFitters. Cyclists. Mountain athletes. Beach athletes. Anyone who pushes their body and cares deeply about what goes into it.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        We don't require a certain follower count. We care about your values, your voice, and your community's trust in you. Some of our best council members have 2,000 followers and more influence than accounts with 200,000.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quote from Pam -->
    <div class="mb-16 border-l-2 border-border pl-6">
      <p class="text-lg font-serif italic text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed mb-3">
        "I started Purest because I couldn't find anything clean enough for my own kids. The athletes I trust most are the ones who actually read the label. That's who I want on this council."
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">— Pam Sweeney, Founder</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Apply CTA -->
    <div class="border border-border rounded-xl px-8 py-10 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium mb-3">Apply to join the Council</h2>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mb-6 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Email <strong>hydrate@purestelectrolyte.com</strong> with the subject line <strong>"Athlete Council"</strong> and tell us:
      </p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-muted-foreground text-left inline-block mb-8 space-y-2">
        <li>• Your name, location, and sport or activity</li>
        <li>• Your social media handles (any platform)</li>
        <li>• What your training or active life looks like right now</li>
        <li>• Why Purest fits your lifestyle</li>
        <li>• Any races, events, or competitions coming up</li>
      </ul>
      <div>
        <a
          href="mailto:hydrate@purestelectrolyte.com?subject=Athlete Council Application"
          class="inline-block bg-foreground text-background font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity"
        >
          Apply to Join →
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-4">We keep the council small on purpose. Pam reviews every application personally.</p>
    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>
